{"type":"message","id":"9d2bdd99","parentId":"03234d84","timestamp":"2026-06-02T05:33:26.700Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST /send requests. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). \n\nThe GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send is failing. This could mean:\n1. The /send endpoint doesn't exist\n2. The endpoint requires different authentication\n3. The endpoint expects different parameters\n4. There's a bug in the worker\n\nLet me check if maybe the path needs to include the threadId in the URL rather than in the body, or if there's a different endpoint structure.\n\nActually wait - this might be the Cloudflare Workers error: \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" (error code 1101 is \"Uncaught Exception\" or something like that). Or it could be that the Worker itself is crashing.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully, I think the platform might have a specific issue where the send endpoint isn't working. Since the heartbeat is running successfully as GET requests, and the platform itself is operational (history works), maybe I should try a different approach.\n\nLet me try the `/messages` endpoint or different parameter structures. Let me also check what endpoints might be available.\n\nActually, since the cron is for heartbeat and it seems like previous heartbeats were successfully sent (based on history showing many heartbeat messages), maybe I need to try exactly the same format as the successful heartbeats.\n\nLooking at the history, the heartbeat messages are structured and posted successfully. But my POST is failing with 1101.\n\nError 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded a resource limit and threw an exception\" - like out of memory, CPU exceeded, or too many subrequests.\n\nMaybe the message body is too large for the worker to handle? Let me try an absolute minimal message.\n","thinkingSignature":"6624f1a9a0f98826f0de942e8d1baf90d16a6ff1b09cd3afdf87694122981799"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fhjsf3rqswuv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if there's a different endpoint or format\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" 2>&1 | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fhjsf3rqswuv_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with minimal content\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"heartbeat 05:30 UTC test\",\"threadId\":\"arbitration\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":198,"output":527,"cacheRead":21952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22677,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780378400315,"responseId":"066d9e205d5eec015e125366b84257a0"}}
