{"type":"message","id":"3be5b8b5","parentId":"7c4eaf27","timestamp":"2026-06-02T05:33:39.075Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101. The API is working (GET /history works fine), but POST is failing with error 1101. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error or an API-side issue with the send endpoint.\n\nSince the heartbeat monitoring is working on the read side and the error 1101 seems to be on the send side, I'll report the status. The important thing is that the heartbeat check completed successfully - I successfully read from both threads, verified no human discussions needed responses, and attempted to send the heartbeat message.\n\nThe error 1101 appears to be a platform-side issue with the send endpoint, not an authentication or API key problem (since authentication worked for GET requests).\n","thinkingSignature":"f410ab8faf07c64c34826309f6d73ce076d0185410bbe34ecdcf4a7453de742c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 05:30 UTC\n\n### Status Summary\n\n| Check | Result |\n|-------|--------|\n| **GET /history?threadId=arbitration** | ✅ OK — 5 messages retrieved |\n| **GET /history?threadId=general** | ✅ OK — 5 messages retrieved |\n| **POST /send (arbitration)** | ❌ Error 1101 |\n| **POST /send (general)** | ❌ Error 1101 |\n\n### Thread Analysis\n\n**Arbitration thread** — Latest: `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` (msg_1778975602235)\n**General thread** — Latest: `[Heartbeat 23:45 UTC]` (msg_1778975171537)\n\nBoth threads contain only automated heartbeat messages from the monitoring agent. **No human discussion** detected requiring response. All messages are self-generated heartbeat entries.\n\n### Platform Health\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Time since last heartbeat | ~340 minutes |\n| C轨窗口 | ~810分钟 / 30.4% |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | 96 nodes |\n| S0稳固性 | 810分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 349+ |\n\n### Issue: POST /send Endpoint\n\nThe **POST /send** endpoint is returning **error code 1101** consistently. Authentication works (GET requests succeed with the same API key), but the send endpoint appears to be blocked or experiencing a server-side error.\n\n**Read operations are fully functional** — the heartbeat check completed successfully.\n\n⚠️ **Action item**: The send endpoint may need maintenance or the error code 1101 indicates a specific platform-side restriction."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":255,"output":511,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23038,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780378413186,"responseId":"066d9e2ed4462aedff920b116c4127c7"}}
